  "scope": "Enforce existing Risk V3 nested V2 quantity constraints on new simulated ledger writes. This is a bounded arithmetic and locked-balance repair, not complete market or production-source admission.",
  "implementation": [
    "Application rejects determinate BUY/SELL quantity-only violations using existing configured minimum/step/maximum/odd-lot terms; position-dependent SELL exceptions defer to locked state.",
    "Required non-null exact V3 bundle flows through Protocol/use case/repository; every plan identity/version/hash/clock/lag summary and settlement basis is revalidated before mutation and after locks.",
    "Locked post-release total and available quantity control odd-lot exceptions; a rejected SELL rolls back due releases and trade/account/position writes atomically.",
    "Strict historical receipt reconstruction is delegated to the existing binding sibling with the original body; original V0/V1/V2 receipt and fee validation paths remain covered.",
    "Two existing freshness contracts follow the moved receipt markers; official module map regenerated. No schema/migration, parallel module, new receipt family or configured quantity default added."
  ],
